        <p><span>5.4</span><strong>Third party items:</strong> Where the Customer is responsible for providing third party items including software or hard-ware, the Customer shall obtain all necessary licenses and consents for the Customer, ClearTax, its personnel and its third party service provider to use such items for the purposes of the Agreement.</p>
